Q5. Two users buy the last product.

Prevent overselling.

We used Optimistic Locking.

Inventory

Product

Quantity

Version

Thread A:

Version = 10

Updates to 11

Success.

Thread B:

Still has version 10.

Update fails.

Retries after reading the latest quantity.

No overselling.


---

Why not pessimistic locking?

Locks rows.

Higher contention.

Lower throughput.

Suitable only for extremely high-value transactions.


